  "question": {
    "text": "The angle between the tangents drawn from the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> to the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given parabola is <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Equation of tangent in slope form to this parabola is&nbsp;<br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />It passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> so<br /><math><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />If <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are roots of this equation, then<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />The angle between the tangents <math><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msqrt><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
